# A section heading at level one

[Claim]: a claim with *italic*, **bold**, a [link](http://example.com), @[Mentioned], @<Arg>, and a #tag {certainty: 0.8, source: book}

<Argument>: a defended claim supported by reasons.

[Parent]
  + [Support]
  - <Counter>
    +> [Deeper]
  >< [Contradiction]

(1) [P1]: first premise
(2) [P2]: second premise
-- Modus Ponens --
(3) [Conclusion]: the conclusion
